## Invariant rules (true every session, never change mid-build)

- No hard-coded hex values; every visual value comes from context/ui-tokens.md
- Update context/progress-tracker.md when starting and when finishing every unit
- Before touching any third-party library, load its skill/docs (see context/library-docs.md) and only then act
- Work on one feature unit or subsystem at a time; never combine unrelated system boundaries in a single implementation step
- Any decision that is hard, ambiguous, or changes an invariant: stop, write the options, and ask the human before proceeding

